---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="PHV Prep UK Android Is Ready — And We Need 12 Testers"
  description="The Android version of PHV Prep UK is finished. We need 12 testers to unlock the Play Store launch — join the beta and get free full access."
  image="/images/android-beta-testers.png"
>
  <main class="md:flex md:justify-center">
    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-[750px]">
      <img
        src="/images/android-beta-testers.png"
        alt="PHV Prep UK Android is ready — become a beta tester"
        width="1200"
        height="630"
        class="rounded-lg"
      />

      <h1>PHV Prep UK Android Is Ready — And We Need 12 Testers</h1>

      <p>
        The Android version of PHV Prep UK is finished. Same full app that's
        live on iPhone — 300+ questions, timed mock exams, the AI Tutor, all of
        it — now built and ready for Android.
      </p>

      <p>
        There's just one step left before it can go live on the Google Play
        Store: Google requires 12 people to test the app first. That's the only
        thing standing between the Android version and a public launch.
      </p>

      <p>
        That's where you come in. If you've got an Android phone and two
        minutes, you can help get it over the line — and you get free full
        access while it's in testing.
      </p>

      <h2>How to join</h2>

      <ol>
        <li>
          Join the tester group:
          <a
            href="https://groups.google.com/g/phv-prep-uk-android-testers"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            >groups.google.com/g/phv-prep-uk-android-testers</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          Wait a few minutes, then open this link on your Android phone:
          <a
            href="https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.phvprepuk.app"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener"
            >play.google.com/apps/testing/com.phvprepuk.app</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          Tap "Become a tester" — this is the step that enrols you.
        </li>
        <li>
          Open the Play Store, search PHV Prep UK, and install.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <p>
        Once we hit 12 testers, the countdown to launch begins. If you're a
        Wolverhampton PHV driver on Android — or you know someone who is — this
        is the moment your help makes the difference.
      </p>

      <hr />

      <p>
        PHV Prep UK is built specifically for the Wolverhampton private hire
        (taxi badge) test. One payment, lifetime access — no subscription.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
